flowchart TB
  accTitle: Python code mode trust boundaries
  accDescr: Framework, Server workers and agentd executors share the host Python tool bridge. Monty executes in a disposable kernel-restricted worker. The host mediates authorized tools and stores private checkpoints and effect outcomes.
  F[Framework host] --> B[Python tool bridge: turn allowlist, approvals, workspace, egress and credentials]
  S[Server worker] --> B
  A[agentd executor] --> B
  B -->|execute and resume| M[Disposable Monty worker: kernel restrictions, no ambient host access]
  M -->|tool suspension| B
  B -->|checkpoints and effect outcomes| J[Private journal: platform store, Raft records or Framework directory]
